_Getctype and _Mbrtowc had no model: the ctype facets of the MSVC STL
read an unknown table, and the "no body" checks of the two functions
failed in every test that constructs the standard streams (VS 2026 CI:
cpp17_iostream_basic, cpp20_iostream_basic).
